  <text xml:lang="grc">
    <body xml:base="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0085.dubia_spuria.nauck1889-grc1"><div type="edition" n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0085.dubia_spuria.nauck1889-grc1" xml:lang="grc" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentarycollections.v1:dubia_spuria"><head xml:lang="grc">FRAGMENTA DVBIA ET SPVRIA</head>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="452" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentarycollections.v1:dubia_spuria" xml:id="aesch-fr452">
            <lg xml:lang="grc">
              <l n="1" xml:id="nauck-tfg-1-aesch-452-1">χωρὶς τὰ Μυσῶν καὶ Φρυγῶν ὁρίσματα.</l>
            </lg>
            <note type="sourceContext" xml:lang="mul">Strabo XII p. 572 : ταῦτα δ᾽ ἐστὶν ἀληθῆ, ὥσπερ καὶ τὸ Αἰσχύλου «χωρὶς — ὁρίσματα». Aeschylo tribuitur a Strabone, sed Sophocli vindicant alii; vide fr. 271 et Soph. fr. 560.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="453" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentarycollections.v1:dubia_spuria" xml:id="aesch-fr453">
            <lg xml:lang="grc">
              <l n="1" xml:id="nauck-tfg-1-aesch-453-1">κἀγὼ πρὸς αὐτὸν εἶπα, σοῦ δ᾽ ἤκουον.</l>
            </lg>
            <note type="sourceContext" xml:lang="mul">Plut. Mor. p. 82 F : τοῦτο δ᾽ ἐστὶ τὸ Αἰσχύλου «κἀγὼ — ἤκουον». cf. Soph. Ant. 1173.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="454" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentarycollections.v1:dubia_spuria" xml:id="aesch-fr454">
            <lg xml:lang="grc">
              <l n="1" xml:id="nauck-tfg-1-aesch-454-1">βέβληκεν Ἀχιλλεὺς δύο κύβω καὶ τέσσαρα.</l>
            </lg>
            <note type="sourceContext" xml:lang="mul">Eust. Il. p. 1282, 33 : ...ὅπερ Αἰσχύλος ἐν Μυρμιδόσιν ἢ Σοφοκλῆς ἐν Παλαμήδῃ εἶπε, τὸ «βέβληκεν — τέσσαρα». vide fr. 131 et Soph. fr. 438.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="455" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentarycollections.v1:dubia_spuria" xml:id="aesch-fr455">
            <lg xml:lang="grc">
              <l n="1" xml:id="nauck-tfg-1-aesch-455-1">σοφὸς γὰρ οὐδεὶς πλὴν ὁ πανταρχῶν θεός.</l>
            </lg>
            <note type="sourceContext" xml:lang="mul">Stob. Flor. 104, 6 : (ubi Αἰσχύλου in cod. A legitur, Σοφοκλέους in ceteris) . vide fr. 347 et Soph. fr. 744.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="456" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentarycollections.v1:dubia_spuria" xml:id="aesch-fr456">
            <lg xml:lang="grc">
              <l n="1" xml:id="nauck-tfg-1-aesch-456-1">τύχη γὰρ ὀρθοῖ καὶ τύχη πίπτει βροτούς.</l>
            </lg>
            <note type="sourceContext" xml:lang="mul">Pertinet ad fr. 374 et Soph. fr. 752.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="457" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentarycollections.v1:dubia_spuria" xml:id="aesch-fr457">
            <lg xml:lang="grc">
              <l n="1" xml:id="nauck-tfg-1-aesch-457-1">τύχης δὲ θνητὸς οὐδὲ εἷς ἐλεύθερος.</l>
            </lg>
            <note type="sourceContext" xml:lang="mul">Pertinet ad fr. 366 et Soph. fr. 751.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="458" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentarycollections.v1:dubia_spuria" xml:id="aesch-fr458">
            <lg xml:lang="grc">
              <l n="1" xml:id="nauck-tfg-1-aesch-458-1">τὸ γὰρ βρότειον σπέρμα τὴν τύχην τρέφει.</l>
            </lg>
            <note type="sourceContext" xml:lang="mul">Pertinet ad fr. 367 et Pind. fr. 240.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="459" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentarycollections.v1:dubia_spuria" xml:id="aesch-fr459">
            <lg xml:lang="grc">
              <l n="1" xml:id="nauck-tfg-1-aesch-459-1">ὁ θάνατος ἔσχατον κακῶν ἰατρός.</l>
            </lg>
            <note type="sourceContext" xml:lang="mul">Pertinet ad fr. 357 et Soph. fr. 748.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="460" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentarycollections.v1:dubia_spuria" xml:id="aesch-fr460">
            <lg xml:lang="grc">
              <l n="1" xml:id="nauck-tfg-1-aesch-460-1">μόνη γὰρ οὐκ ἔπεστιν ἐλπὶς ἐν νεκροῖς.</l>
            </lg>
            <note type="sourceContext" xml:lang="mul">Pertinet ad fr. 362 et Soph. fr. 750.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="461" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentarycollections.v1:dubia_spuria" xml:id="aesch-fr461">
            <lg xml:lang="grc">
              <l n="1" xml:id="nauck-tfg-1-aesch-461-1">οἵαπερ ἡ δέσποινα, τοία χἠ κύων.</l>
            </lg>
            <note type="sourceContext" xml:lang="mul">Pertinet ad fr. 415.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="462" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentarycollections.v1:dubia_spuria" xml:id="aesch-fr462">
            <lg xml:lang="grc">
              <l n="1" xml:id="nauck-tfg-1-aesch-462-1">ὅρκοι γὰρ ἐν κακοῖσι νηλεεῖς βροτῶν.</l>
            </lg>
            <note type="sourceContext" xml:lang="mul">Stob. Flor. 28, 2 : Αἰσχύλου (Aeschyli nomen in A tantum legitur) . sed Sophocli tribuitur in Flor. SM, vide Soph. fr. 741.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="463" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentarycollections.v1:dubia_spuria" xml:id="aesch-fr463">
            <lg xml:lang="grc">
              <l n="1" xml:id="nauck-tfg-1-aesch-463-1">γυναιξὶ δ᾽ ἔστ᾽ ἄδηλος ἡ σιγὴ βλάβη.</l>
            </lg>
            <note type="sourceContext" xml:lang="mul">Stob. Flor. 33, 4 : Αἰσχύλου (legitur in A, Euripidis in SM) . vide Eur. fr. 905.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="464" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentarycollections.v1:dubia_spuria" xml:id="aesch-fr464">
            <lg xml:lang="grc">
              <l n="1" xml:id="nauck-tfg-1-aesch-464-1">δύναται τὸ θεῖον δούλιον φαίνειν ἐλεύθερον.</l>
            </lg>
            <note type="sourceContext" xml:lang="mul">Stob. Flor. 48, 14 : Αἰσχύλου (legitur in A, Euripidis in SM) . vide Eur. fr. 906.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="465" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentarycollections.v1:dubia_spuria" xml:id="aesch-fr465">
            <lg xml:lang="grc">
              <l n="1" xml:id="nauck-tfg-1-aesch-465-1">ἀλλ᾽ ἔστιν οἰκτρὸν εὐτυχῆ πεσεῖν κακῶς.</l>
            </lg>
            <note type="sourceContext" xml:lang="mul">Repetitum ex fr. 356.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="466" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentarycollections.v1:dubia_spuria" xml:id="aesch-fr466">
            <lg xml:lang="grc">
              <l n="1" xml:id="nauck-tfg-1-aesch-466-1">οὐδεὶς ἀνάγκης ἐστὶν ἰσχυρότερος.</l>
            </lg>
            <note type="sourceContext" xml:lang="mul">Stob. Flor. 121, 20 : Αἰσχύλου (legitur in A, Euripidis in SM) . vide Aesch. Prom. 514 et Eur. Alc. 965.</note>
          </div>
        </div></body></text>
